# xtiles of ipl_gpacks (xtiles), the tile game, run under its clock pin (xtiles.pin: it draws its colours and its puzzle from &clock): three
# sets zapped by clicks (the blue block at the top, the cyan block at the left, the orange block in the middle), u undoes the last, the
# orange block zapped again, q asks to quit and y answers it. The 10 by 10 field of 35-pixel tiles stands at 0 0.
move 100 17
wait
click 1 100 17
wait
click 1 35 245
wait
click 1 155 90
wait
key u
wait
click 1 155 90
wait
key q
wait
key y
